Bridge phone field captures into the task Activity trail

Phone /field/capture now logs against a TASK (not an asset): the mer_field_events
row asset_id carries the task id. The seeded task page loads + subscribes to
those rows, converts each to an Activity (timestamp, actor, kind, comment,
with_party, photo) and merges it into the trail - so it feeds the Activity
timeline, the silence metrics, the Synopsis (new field-reports-from-site row +
last-activity), and the AI root-cause entry count, all live and cross-device.

